OL,3,GNEWSARapist who threatened to kill
OL,4,Ateenager jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist who threatened to kill a
OL,7,Fteenager after assaulting her in a
OL,8,Fsecluded area of Tunbridge Wells has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for more than 10 years.
OL,11,FItalian national Rocco Minafra, from
OL,12,FTonbridge, called his victim over and
OL,13,Ftook her to a bench on Tunbridge Wells
OL,14,FCommon between 20:00 BST and 21:00 on
OL,15,F18 October 2025, before pulling her
OL,16,Fdown a slope and attacking her.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
