OL,3,GNEWSARapist who threatened to kill
OL,4,Ateenager jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Maidstone Crown Court, 47-year-old
OL,7,FMinafra was given a prison sentence of
OL,8,F10 years and nine months and issued
OL,9,Fwith a 15-year Sexual Harm Prevention
OL,10,FOrder after being found guilty of rape,
OL,11,Fmaking a threat to kill, and three
OL,12,Fcounts of sexual assault.
OL,14,FKent Police praised the victim's
OL,15,Fbravery following sentencing.
